---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTABand from '../../../components/CTABand.astro';
import StructuredData from '../../../components/StructuredData.astro';

const articleData = {
  headline: 'How to Choose the Best Cosmetic Dentist in Minnetonka, MN',
  description:
    'Five factors to weigh when choosing a cosmetic dentist in Minnetonka, MN — experience, technology, real results, and personalized communication.',
  datePublished: '2025-11-19',
  author: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Center for Smile Enhancement',
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How to Choose the Best Cosmetic Dentist in Minnetonka, MN"
  description="Choosing a cosmetic dentist in Minnetonka, MN? Here are five factors — experience, technology, results, and communication — to weigh before you book."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="Cosmetic Dentistry"
      title="How to Choose the Best Cosmetic Dentist in Minnetonka, MN"
      breadcrumbs={[
        { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
        { label: 'Blog', href: '/blog/' },
        { label: 'Choosing a Cosmetic Dentist' },
      ]}
    />

    <section aria-label="Article content" class="section-white">
      <div class="site-container section-py">
        <div class="article-prose">
          <p>Your smile deserves exceptional care. Whether you’re considering veneers, whitening, or a full smile makeover, finding the right cosmetic dentist in Minnetonka is key. Here’s what to look for—and why so many patients trust <strong>Dr. Michael Sudit</strong> for beautiful, natural-looking results.</p>

          <h2><strong>1. Experience and Credentials Matter</strong></h2>

          <p>Cosmetic dentistry requires both artistry and technical skill. Dr. Sudit’s advanced training in aesthetic procedures ensures each treatment enhances your unique facial features and natural beauty, and Dr. Michael Sudit has been nominated as Best Dentist in Minneapolis for over a decade.</p>

          <h2><strong>2. Technology and Techniques Used</strong></h2>

          <p>Modern digital imaging and minimally invasive techniques deliver precise, comfortable, and long-lasting results. Ask your dentist about the technology they use for planning and restoration.</p>

          <h2><strong>3. Before-and-After Gallery</strong></h2>

          <p>A smile gallery is a great way to preview real patient results. View Dr. Sudit’s Smile Gallery to see transformations completed right here in Minnetonka.</p>

          <h2><strong>4. Personalized Care and Communication</strong></h2>

          <p>The best cosmetic dentists listen first. At <strong>The Center for Smile Enhancement</strong>, we take time to understand your goals, answer questions, and create a plan tailored just for you.</p>

          <h2><strong>5. Comprehensive Services</strong></h2>

          <p>Look for a practice that offers everything from preventive care to full smile makeovers. This ensures continuity and convenience for all your dental needs.</p>

          <h2><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>

          <p><strong>1. What’s the difference between a general and cosmetic dentist?</strong> Cosmetic dentists focus on improving the aesthetics of your smile, in addition to overall health.</p>

          <p><strong>2. How much does cosmetic dentistry cost?</strong> Pricing varies depending on the procedure; consultations help provide accurate estimates.</p>

          <p><strong>3. Are cosmetic dental procedures covered by insurance?</strong> Most are elective, but financing options are available through our office.</p>

          <p><strong>4. How long do cosmetic results last?</strong> With good oral hygiene, results can last many years.</p>

          <p><strong>5. Why choose Dr. Sudit for cosmetic dentistry?</strong> He combines advanced techniques, artistry, and personalized care to deliver stunning, natural-looking smiles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <CTABand
      heading="Ready to Enhance Your Smile?"
      sub="Schedule a complimentary cosmetic consultation and let's discuss which options are right for you."
    />
  </main>

  <Footer />

  <StructuredData type="Article" data={articleData} />
</BaseLayout>
